{"about_the_game":"It was just supposed to be a job. To help build the next off-world space colony by remotely operating a robotic construction unit, establishing a direct neural link with the machine to control it as if it were your own body. Perfectly safe, they said. Until something went wrong.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow, trapped in an artificial body and stranded light-years from Earth your only hope is to re-establish contact with the outside world so that you can attempt to re-claim your human body and make it back home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA 2D platform-adventure game in a large, interconnected world where you'll use action, exploration and puzzle-solving to acquire new abilities and make your way though a space colony full of robots run amok.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2931010?t=1772915867","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2931010?t=1772915867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772915867","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772915867","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"It was just supposed to be a job. To help build the next off-world space colony by remotely operating a robotic construction unit, establishing a direct neural link with the machine to control it as if it were your own body. Perfectly safe, they said. Until something went wrong.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow, trapped in an artificial body and stranded light-years from Earth your only hope is to re-establish contact with the outside world so that you can attempt to re-claim your human body and make it back home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA 2D pl